Missing Context Checklist
Business rules: the revenue-recognition policy you want (cash or accrual), discount thresholds, refund policy, credit and insurance contracts, incentive or commission rules, and licence-lapse policy.
Payroll rules: the current Ethiopian PAYE brackets and pension treatment you must follow, and the allowance taxability schedule.
Deployment: the target database (MySQL only, or SQLite for small sites), hosting (LAN server or cloud), reverse proxy and TLS setup, backup approach, and .env in production.
Missing code: any server/routes split or middleware I did not see (the files shown contain no tests, migrations or CI config), and any scripts for backup or jobs.
Data volume: expected patients, daily visits and staff count, which set pagination, indexing and queue-sizing choices.
Regulatory: MoH reporting (HMIS/DHIS2) requirements, local health-records retention, and data-protection obligations.
Integrations: SMS gateway, mobile money, lab analysers, PACS, fingerprint attendance devices.
Roles in practice: whether one person holds several roles in your pilot clinic. That drives the multi-role fixes.